  📗
    The answer to a probe: 200 and {"status":"ok"} when the server is not
    stopping and every check passes, with the checks listed when there are
    any; 503 and "failing" when one does not; 503 and "stopping", with no
    check asked, once a stop was asked for. Never to be cached.
